;\">	</span>5),<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>dan<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">	</span>6)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd', 1701561860, 1701561860, 0, '', 1, 0, 0, '71e9e3e1-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:23', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
