ational football in September 2021. Currently his net worth is around 500 million and this makes him one of the richest athletes.</p><p>Decide whether these statement is correct from each paragraph according to the text above</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a:3:{s:5:\"model\";s:1:\"1\";s:4:\"type\";s:1:\"2\";s:7:\"jawaban\";a:5:{i:0;a:5:{i:0;s:9:\"<p>#</p>\n\";i:1;s:21:\"<p>Paragraph four</p>\";i:2;s:20:\"<p>Paragraph two</p>\";i:3;s:20:\"<p>Paragraph one</p>\";i:4;s:22:\"<p>Paragraph three</p>\";}i:1;a:5:{i:0;s:86:\"<p>Ronaldo can run very fast, he can run with a speed of 33.6 kilometers per hour</p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"0\";i:2;s:1:\"0\";i:3;s:1:\"0\";i:4;s:1:\"1\";}i:2;a:5:{i:0;s:73:\"<p>He trained himself continuously from morning until evening</p><p></p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"0\";i:2;s:1:\"0\";i:3;s:1:\"1\";i:4;s:1:\"0\";}i:3;a:5:{i:0;s:48:\"<p>He can&nbsp; jump up to 78 cm in the air</p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"1\";i:2;s:1:\"0\";i:3;s:1:\"0\";i:4;s:1:\"0\";}i:4;a:5:{i:0;s:49:\"<p>Ronaldo becomes so skillful and confident</p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"0\";i:2;s:1:\"1\";i:3;s:1:\"0\";i:4;s:1:\"0\";}}}', 1729054120, 1729749408, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '71fa6d3f-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:32', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
