 membentuk karakteristik wilayah</span><o:p></o:p></p>\";s:1:\"c\";s:338:\"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Pendekatan keruangan upaya dalam rangkaian persamaan dari\r\ndalam ruang</span><o:p></o:p></p>\";}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"a\";i:1;s:1:\"b\";i:2;N;}', 1729073416, 1729562415, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '71fd8e6b-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:33', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
