ded so you have to be careful in order not to get lost.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">\r\nWords<b> it </b>in line 4 refers to ....</p>', 'The plantation ', 'Luxury branded things ', 'The plaza  ', 'Singapore ', 'Suburban street ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'e', 1729570882, 1729571006, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72061299-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:38', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
