so you have to be careful in order not to get lost.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">\r\nThe word <b>satisfy</b> in line eighth has the closet meaning with .... </p>', 'Pleased', 'Free', 'Frighten ', 'Threat', 'Loved', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a', 1729571023, 1729571177, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '720618a5-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:38', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
