 class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> adalah…', '1 : 2<br>', '&nbsp;2 : 1<br>', '4 : 1<br>', '&nbsp;1 : 4<br>', '&nbsp;3 : 1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c', 1764127779, 1764207568, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '720d9a5e-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:43', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
