e6-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_soal` (`id_soal`, `bank_id`, `mapel_id`, `jenis`, `nomor_soal`, `file`, `file1`, `tipe_file`, `soal`, `opsi_a`, `opsi_b`, `opsi_c`, `opsi_d`, `opsi_e`, `file_a`, `file_b`, `file_c`, `file_d`, `file_e`, `jawaban`, `created_on`, `updated_on`, `tampilkan`, `deskripsi`, `kesulitan`, `timer`, `timer_menit`, `sync_uuid`, `sync_status`, `sync_at`, `sync_origin`, `sync_school_uuid`, `deleted_at`) VALUES (31351, 873, 0, 1, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">The Legend of the Holy stone</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nA long time ago, up on the Kamboi Rama mountain, there were two villages, kamboi Rama and Aroempu. Komboi Rama was a residence for Kamboi people and Aroempu was a sago plantation owned by God Iriwonawani, who also owned a Tifa. Whenever the tifa is played, the Komboi people would gather. Every day, the Kombai women would go to Aroempu to cut sago for their meals. As time passed by, the sago trees were becoming scarced.God Iriwonawani got really anggry, Get ot of here! Don’t just cut but saw and plant! Because they were scared , the Kamboy people moved to the coastal area and named themselves Randuayaivi. However upon the mountain, there still lived a couple of husband and wife, Irimiami and Isoray.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nOne day, on their way home after a hunt in the jungle, being tired, Irimiami and Isoray decided to rest. Irimiami sat on the ground leaning on a tree. Meanwhile, Isoray was still finding a place to sit. She Saw a large stone and thought that it would be comfortable to sit on. As she sat, all a sudden, Isoray shouthed and jumped off the stone. Ouch! The stone is so hot that I almost got burned! Isoray cried. What is it,dear? Irimiami who almost fell asleep immediately stood up, startled by his wife’s screaams. I don’t know what happened either, but this stone feels really hot. Answered Isoray in panic.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nA short time later, in their astonishment, smoke came out of that stone. Corious, Irimiami tried to sit on that stone. Ouch! It’s really hot! He shouted. Becoming more corious, the couple decided to test the stone’s head.How if we put this venison on the stone?said Irimiami. Let’s just try, dear, answered Isoray. Exquisite smells came from the burning meat. As it was ready they ate them up.what a delicious piece of meat or this meat is so delicious,Irimiami said happily. Unsatisfied what they found, they continued testing the stone. Let’s try to put these bamboo stems, said Isoray. Let’s try the grass and leaves, Irimiami added. How about that timber! Shouted Isoray. Day by day, they kept on testing the stone.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nOne bright day, they gathered more grasses and put them on the stone. The grasses burned quickly and spread to the sorrounding plants the fire got bigger. They started to panic. My husband, we’ve burned this place. Isoray cried in fear. It’s a bigger and we can not stop. Let’s meet Got Iriwonawani for help, said Irimiami in tremble. They ran to Got Iriwonawani.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nMy Lord, please help us put out the fire, begged them. Well, I shall help on the condition that you stop that harming act of yours, said the God. We promise, my lord, they said with a magical power, the fire could finally be stopped.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nNevertheless, it seemed that they had not learned from their mistakes. They kept on testing the stone, until one day they started a really big fire that did not stop for seven days and nights. They were really terified and could not anything but asked Got Iriwonawai for help.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nFinally the sound of the tifa were heard again after a long time. All Randuayaivi people ran to Kamboi mountain, witnessed the burning forest which was again successfully estinguished by Got Iriwonawani. On the mountain, Irimiami and Isoray finally told the story of the holly stone.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">\r\nThe following day,all Randuayaivi people come back to the mountain bringing food items. All those food items were put on the holly stone and the traditional feast took place for three days and night. All the people chanted and dance around the holly stone, worshsipping it and passing the holly stone the holy stone story. People in papua, particullary those of Yepen Islands,sanctify the fire stone Hitherto. The stone has become a secred stone that they worship annually.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">     What kind of the persons are Irimiami and Isoray?</span></div>', 'Probing', 'Shameless', 'Ambitious', 'self-centered', 'Hardworking', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a', 1764297024, 1764901044, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72149905-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_soal` (`id_soal`, `bank_id`, `mapel_id`, `jenis`, `nomor_soal`, `file`, `file1`, `tipe_file`, `soal`, `opsi_a`, `opsi_b`, `opsi_c`, `opsi_d`, `opsi_e`, `file_a`, `file_b`, `file_c`, `file_d`, `file_e`, `jawaban`, `created_on`, `updated_on`, `tampilkan`, `deskripsi`, `kesulitan`, `timer`, `timer_menit`, `sync_uuid`, `sync_status`, `sync_at`, `sync_origin`, `sync_school_uuid`, `deleted_at`) VALUES (31352, 871, 0, 1, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>The Hen with the Silver Eggs\r\n\r\nOne day, in an Arabian city, a woman went to the market and bought a beautiful hen. A few days later to her surprise the hen she bought laid a silver egg. If the hen could only be persuaded to lay more than one egg each day, the woman was sure she would never have to work again.\r\n\r\nSo the woman decided to make the hen eat more, so that it could lay more eggs. But the only result was that the hen died of indigestion and did not lay more eggs at all.</p><p> Paragraph 3 mostly discusses about ...</p>', 'the hen\'s eggs', 'what the woman did to her hen', 'what the hen did for the woman', 'what the hen eats to lay more eggs', 'why the woman wanted to get more eggs', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'b', 1764297061, 1764297198, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72149a61-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_soal` (`id_soal`, `bank_id`, `mapel_id`, `jenis`, `nomor_soal`, `file`, `file1`, `tipe_file`, `soal`, `opsi_a`, `opsi_b`, `opsi_c`, `opsi_d`, `opsi_e`, `file_a`, `file_b`, `file_c`, `file_d`, `file_e`, `jawaban`, `created_on`, `updated_on`, `tampilkan`, `deskripsi`, `kesulitan`, `timer`, `timer_menit`, `sync_uuid`, `sync_status`, `sync_at`, `sync_origin`, `sync_school_uuid`, `deleted_at`) VALUES (31353, 815, 0, 3, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Dalam kehidupan sehari-hari, banyak peristiwa yang tampak sederhana ternyata melibatkan reaksi kimia. Untuk menganalisis apakah suatu peristiwa merupakan reaksi kimia atau perubahan fisika, kita perlu memahami ciri-ciri reaksi kimia, seperti perubahan warna, terbentuknya gas, endapan, perubahan suhu, dan munculnya cahaya. </p><p>Tariklah garis untuk pasangan yang tepat dengan menghubungkan peristiwa reaksi kimia dengan ciri reaksi yang tepat.</p></body></html>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"model\":\"1\",\"type\":\"2\",\"jawaban\":[[\"#\",\"<p>Terbentuk gas<br><\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"<p>Perubahan warna<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"<p>Terbentuk endapan<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"<p>Perubahan suhu<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"<p>Menghasilkan cahaya<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\"],[\"<li data-start=\\\"969\\\" data-end=\\\"1150\\\"><p data-start=\\\"972\\\" data-end=\\\"1150\\\">Seorang siswa meletakkan tablet effervescent dalam air. Muncul gelembung dan suhu air sedikit turun. Untuk membuktikan terjadi reaksi kimia, ciri utama yang paling kuat.<\\/p><\\/li><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"1\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\"],[\"<p>Ketika cermin perak diletakkan di ruangan lembap dalam waktu lama, muncul lapisan kehitaman pada permukaannya.<\\/p><p><\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"0\",\"1\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\"],[\"<li data-start=\\\"1267\\\" data-end=\\\"1383\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1383\\\">Dalam percobaan fotosintesis, seorang siswa mengamati gelembung kecil pada daun Hydrilla ketika terkena cahaya.<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1384\\\" data-end=\\\"1483\\\"><\\/li><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"1\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\"],[\"<p>Dua larutan bening dicampurkan: setelah beberapa detik terbentuk padatan putih di dasar gelas.<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"0\",\"0\",\"1\",\"0\",\"0\"],[\"<p>Sebuah kabel tembaga dipanaskan kuat hingga bersinar merah-oranye. Guru meminta siswa menentukan ciri reaksi kimia yang teramati.<\\/p><\\/body><\\/html>\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\",\"0\",\"1\"]]}', 1764297122, 1765350340, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72149c09-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_soal` (`id_soal`, `bank_id`, `mapel_id`, `jenis`, `nomor_soal`, `file`, `file1`, `tipe_file`, `soal`, `opsi_a`, `opsi_b`, `opsi_c`, `opsi_d`, `opsi_e`, `file_a`, `file_b`, `file_c`, `file_d`, `file_e`, `jawaban`, `created_on`, `updated_on`, `tampilkan`, `deskripsi`, `kesulitan`, `timer`, `timer_menit`, `sync_uuid`, `sync_status`, `sync_at`, `sync_origin`, `sync_school_uuid`, `deleted_at`) VALUES (31354, 871, 0, 1, 26, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>The Hen with the Silver Eggs\r\n\r\nOne day, in an Arabian city, a woman went to the market and bought a beautiful hen. A few days later to her surprise the hen she bought laid a silver egg. If the hen could only be persuaded to lay more than one egg each day, the woman was sure she would never have to work again.\r\n\r\nSo the woman decided to make the hen eat more, so that it could lay more eggs. But the only result was that the hen died of indigestion and did not lay more eggs at all.</p><p>\r\n\r\nFrom the text we may conclude that the woman was ...</p>', ' active', '<p>miserly</p>', 'greedy', 'furious', 'dangerous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c', 1764297208, 1764297457, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72149cfb-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
INSERT INTO `cbt_soal` (`id_soal`, `bank_id`, `mapel_id`, `jenis`, `nomor_soal`, `file`, `file1`, `tipe_file`, `soal`, `opsi_a`, `opsi_b`, `opsi_c`, `opsi_d`, `opsi_e`, `file_a`, `file_b`, `file_c`, `file_d`, `file_e`, `jawaban`, `created_on`, `updated_on`, `tampilkan`, `deskripsi`, `kesulitan`, `timer`, `timer_menit`, `sync_uuid`, `sync_status`, `sync_at`, `sync_origin`, `sync_school_uuid`, `deleted_at`) VALUES (31355, 785, 0, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"391\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>(PILIHLAH JAWABAN LEBIH DARI SATU)</b></span></p><p data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"391\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Indonesia memiliki letak geografis yang strategis karena beberapa alasan berikut:</span></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"573\">\r\n<li data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"426\">Terletak di antara dua benua.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"463\">Terletak di antara dua samudra.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"509\">Menjadi jalur perdagangan internasional.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"573\">\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"573\">Berada di zona waktu yang sama dengan seluruh Asia Tenggara.</p></li></ol>', 'a:4:{s:1:\"a\";s:24:\"<p>1, 2, dan 3 benar</p>\";s:1:\"b\";s:20:\"<p>1 dan 4 benar</p>\";s:1:\"c\";s:20:\"<p>2 dan 3 benar</p>\";s:1:\"d\";s:29:\"<p>Semua pernyataan benar</p>\";}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a:3:{i:0;s:1:\"a\";i:1;s:1:\"d\";i:2;N;}', 1764297293, 1764297464, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '72149dd4-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
