ign: center;\">Okay, see you then</span></p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"1\";i:2;s:1:\"0\";i:3;s:1:\"0\";i:4;s:1:\"0\";}i:6;a:5:{i:0;s:122:\"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">Then after it gets better you need to mind what you eat</span></p>\n\";i:1;s:1:\"0\";i:2;s:1:\"1\";i:3;s:1:\"0\";i:4;s:1:\"0\";}}}', 1764299827, 1764300101, 1, '', 1, 0, 0, '7215033e-e8d9-11f0-a465-0a0027000004', 'synced', '2026-01-04 14:12:48', 'lokal', 'ece44576-9051-4b66-9b7e-1b85e3666b1b', NULL);
